# Line-ending and text rules for the Linux-only IBC fork.
#
# Shell scripts are the distribution's entry points (twsstart.sh,
# gatewaystart.sh -> scripts/ibcstart.sh): they must be LF-terminated, and their
# executable bit is carried by the git index (mode 100755).
*.sh text eol=lf

# The Maven build rewrites resources/version on every package; it is a build
# output, not a source file.
resources/version -text

# Binary distributions and shipped archives.
*.jar binary
*.zip binary
*.pdf binary
